        "id": "i",
        "marks": 1,
        "text": "Which claim is correct?",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "Jump sizes $1$, $2$, $3$, $4$, $5$, $6$, $10$, $12$, $15$, $20$, $30$ and $60$ all land exactly on $60$."
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "The answer is $60$, because that is the treasure number itself."
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "Jump size $7$ works, because repeated jumps of $7$ stay on whole numbers."
          },
          {
